    "E/W show a concrete current finish regression: the lower visible terminal cap has concentrated cyan pools/bands, approximately published-hero y480..620. Their diffuse centered falloff reads as luminous color spots rather than clear stone edge/plane highlights. At128 they attract attention away from the cap form; at32 they remain bright terminal accents on both light and dark grounds. This is not a claim of white clipping or alpha glow outside the silhouette.",
    "All18 declared files were directly inspected, including actual round03/04 comparison, every mode/case screenshot and full-resolution lossless strips covering all4 desktop screenshots. An additional own full-frame02/03/04 comparison and current independent phone captures confirm the finish assessment at matched use sizes.",
    "True ports remain clean in native and independent comparisons. No old interior groove is treated as a port; no broken geometry, alpha puncture, removed cap, black pit, overhang, raised base or directional ground cast shadow was found. Current exterior precision residuals are separate from the broad shading concern.",
    "The current native analytic normalized-normal lighting, revised height/transverse collar fields and emission surface are allowed methods. All actual field/camera/capture tests pass. The finish verdict comes from current visible outcome, and does not lock any failed old field values, graph type or normal storage method."
  ],
